OL,3,AAI 'kill switch' may need to be
OL,4,Amandatory, Anthropic co-founder says
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn artificial intelligence "kill
OL,7,Fswitch" which can be checked by a third
OL,8,Fparty may need to be mandatory for
OL,9,Fcompanies, a co-founder of one of the
OL,10,Fworld's largest AI firms has said.
OL,12,FJack Clark, one of seven founders of
OL,13,FAnthropic, said a way of shutting off
OL,14,FAI software completely if it gets too
OL,15,Fdangerous was something society "might
OL,16,Fwant to eventually pass rules around".
OL,18,FClark said "most labs have different
OL,19,Fways of being able to pull the plug",
OL,20,Fincluding Anthropic, but said lawmakers
OL,21,Fmay need to enforce having one.
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  BusinessC Nat TVF  Nat News
